  "applicationText": {
    "title": "北京の生活",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l36-app-block-001",
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "小李、小野和太田夫人一起，从建国门向西走。小李和小野向太田夫人打听在北京的生活。现在，太田夫人已经完全习惯了北京的生活，但起初好像遇到过一些困难。",
        "translationZh": "小李、小野和太田夫人一起从建国门向西走。小李和小野向太田夫人打听她在北京的生活。现在太田夫人已完全习惯了北京的生活，但起初似乎遇到过一些困难。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "小李、小野和太田夫人一起，从建国门向西走。小李和小野向太田夫人打听在北京的生活。现在，太田夫人已经完全习惯了北京的生活，但起初好像遇到过一些困难。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l36-app-block-002",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "走到二环路附近，听到“呜呜”的声音。",
        "translationZh": "走到二环路附近时，听到“呜呜”的声音。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（走到二环路附近，听到“呜呜”的声音。）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l36-app-block-003",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l36-app-block-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "何か変な音が聞こえませんか。",
            "translationZh": "你没听见什么奇怪的声音吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：何か変な音が聞こえませんか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l36-app-block-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson36/l36-app-block-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.74,
              "duration": 2.74,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:18:21.043Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c7e35ab4bf325113d41c5ee97e196bd9c090ee728c4ab2dba8c9b5d306ae5045"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l36-app-block-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "凧の音ですよ。",
            "translationZh": "是风筝的声音。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：（手指天空）凧の音ですよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l36-app-block-003-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson36/l36-app-block-003-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.22,
              "duration": 1.22,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:18:21.043Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c7e35ab4bf325113d41c5ee97e196bd9c090ee728c4ab2dba8c9b5d306ae5045"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l36-app-block-003-line-003",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ほら、あそこで凧を揚げているのが見えるでしょう。",
            "translationZh": "你看，看得见那边正在放风筝吧？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ほら、あそこで凧を揚げているのが見えるでしょう。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l36-app-block-003-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson36/l36-app-block-003-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.06,
              "duration": 3.06,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:18:21.043Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c7e35ab4bf325113d41c5ee97e196bd9c090ee728c4ab2dba8c9b5d306ae5045"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l36-app-block-003-line-004",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "あら、ほんと。凧が鳴っているのが聞こえたんですね。",
            "translationZh": "啊，真的。原来是听见风筝在响啊。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：あら、ほんと。凧が鳴っているのが聞こえたんですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l36-app-block-003-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson36/l36-app-block-003-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.18,
              "duration": 4.18,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:18:21.043Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c7e35ab4bf325113d41c5ee97e196bd9c090ee728c4ab2dba8c9b5d306ae5045"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l36-app-block-004",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "小野、小李和太田夫人边走边聊。",
        "translationZh": "小野、小李和太田夫人边走边聊。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（小野、小李和太田夫人边走边聊）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l36-app-block-005",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-001",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "奥さんは、北京の生活に慣れるのに苦労しましたか。",
            "translationZh": "您习惯北京的生活时辛苦吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：奥さんは、北京の生活に慣れるのに苦労しましたか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson36/l36-app-block-005-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.02,
              "duration": 4.02,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:18:21.043Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c7e35ab4bf325113d41c5ee97e196bd9c090ee728c4ab2dba8c9b5d306ae5045"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-002",
            "speaker": "夫人",
            "text": "ええ。とにかく最初は言葉が通じなくて、とても困りました。",
            "translationZh": "是的。总之，最开始语言不通，很伤脑筋。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "夫人：ええ。とにかく最初は言葉が通じなくて、とても困りました。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson36/l36-app-block-005-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.3,
              "duration": 5.3,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:18:21.043Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c7e35ab4bf325113d41c5ee97e196bd9c090ee728c4ab2dba8c9b5d306ae5045"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-003",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "今はどうですか。もうぺらぺらでしょう。",
            "translationZh": "现在怎么样？已经说得很流利了吧？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：今はどうですか。もうぺらぺらでしょう。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson36/l36-app-block-005-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.1,
              "duration": 3.1,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:18:21.043Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c7e35ab4bf325113d41c5ee97e196bd9c090ee728c4ab2dba8c9b5d306ae5045"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-004",
            "speaker": "夫人",
            "text": "いいえ、まだまだです。でも、日常会話には困りません。",
            "translationZh": "不，还差得远呢。不过日常会话没问题。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "夫人：いいえ、まだまだです。でも、日常会話には困りません。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson36/l36-app-block-005-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.58,
              "duration": 4.58,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:18:21.043Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c7e35ab4bf325113d41c5ee97e196bd9c090ee728c4ab2dba8c9b5d306ae5045"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-005",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "買い物は。",
            "translationZh": "那买东西呢？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：買い物は？",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l36-app-block-005-line-005",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson36/l36-app-block-005-line-005.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 0.82,
